          <h2>Evidence-based health creation</h2>
          <p>
            Healthier UK collates peer-reviewed evidence, economic return-on-investment (ROI) data, and qualitative case studies demonstrating the efficacy of community health creation, social prescribing, physical activity, and nature-based interventions.
          </p>
          <p>
            Research consistently demonstrates that every &pound;1 invested in place-based health creation yields substantial long-term returns in avoided healthcare costs, increased economic activity, and enhanced community resilience.
          </p>
